<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - OccuSystems Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - OccuSystems Inc.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities analyst Amy de Rham said she initiated coverage of OccuSystems Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- She said she expects the company to earn $0.59 per share in 1996 and $0.81 per share in 1997.  Her target price for OccuSystems is $38, about 28 percent above current levels.</p>
</text>
